{"publicId":"f5d58a9f-c37e-4f40-bc75-e2903994bf1f","title":"OpenSSH密码验证漏洞（CVE-2016-6210）在musl Linux环境下持续存在","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T12:24:42.504Z","latestAt":"2026-11-05T12:24:42.504Z","digest":"OpenSSH在musl Linux环境下存在密码验证漏洞，允许未设置密码的账户（如root、默认用户等）通过任意超过256字符的密码入侵。该漏洞源于musl libc 2012年修复时未彻底解决算法兼容性问题，导致密码哈希计算失败时未正确拒绝请求。尽管原始CVE-2016-6210报告已标记修复，但musl系统默认配置仍存在漏洞，影响Alpine的AWS/Azure镜像等场景。漏洞利用需满足：1）目标账户未设置密码；2）攻击者使用超过256字符的密码；3）系统运行musl libc且未升级至修复版本。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T12:36:11.737Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"musl Linux 环境下 SSH 密码哈希漏洞的十年修复历程与持续风险","latestReport":{"id":"e7id5u39sxzhczos0hxfcymte"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fGc2gLuD2Cp8","title":"openssh 的密码验证机制存在历史遗留问题","firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T12:24:42.504Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"e7id5u39sxzhczos0hxfcymte","title":"musl Linux 环境下 SSH 密码哈希漏洞的十年修复历程与持续风险","summary":"musl Linux 环境下的 SSH 服务存在安全漏洞（CVE-2016-6210），未设置密码的账户（如 root 或默认用户）可能被 257-1024 字符长度的任意密码入侵。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T12:24:42.504Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"e7id5u39sxzhczos0hxfcymte","title":"musl Linux 环境下 SSH 密码哈希漏洞的十年修复历程与持续风险","summary":"musl Linux 环境下的 SSH 服务存在安全漏洞（CVE-2016-6210），未设置密码的账户（如 root 或默认用户）可能被 257-1024 字符长度的任意密码入侵。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T12:24:42.504Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","heat":